# Baseline snapshots taken around destructive pipeline operations (large, kept
# locally only). Catches both baseline_pre_<change>_<timestamp>/ and the
# baseline_post_<change>_<timestamp>/ variant per the CLAUDE.md backup
# convention — Shumway, intl-Shumway, full-rerun, restructure, and any future
# variants. The earlier baseline_pre_*/ rule missed the _post_ snapshots, so
# baseline_post_intl_phase_c_20260429_155420/ was tracked by accident.
baseline_*/
.last_intl_baseline

# CV smoke + pytest-integration artifacts (kept locally, not in git)
